Peer dependency
  The package declares a peer dependency on @deepseek-ai/cordis, which the
  DeepSeek Harness installation supplies. It has no runtime import of any
  @deepseek-ai/* package: every Harness capability — the web seam, the settings
  service, the web server, the logger — is reached through the Cordis context
  object, and the one error shape the seam needs is defined locally
  (lib/registry.js) so the bundle stays resolvable from a profile.

Reference implementation
  The provider matrix, the request/response shapes of each provider, the Chinese
  copy, the panel geometry and the brand artwork were ported from Kelivo
  (https://github.com/Chevey339/kelivo), a Flutter client licensed AGPL-3.0.
  No Kelivo source code is copied: the adapters in lib/search are independent
  JavaScript implementations of the same public HTTP APIs, and the client UI is
  an independent implementation of the same layout using DSH theme variables.
  Kelivo's own local web-fetch service was deliberately not ported.

Brand artwork
